{%- comment -%}
  pdp4 — kenapa yang ini. Salinan DOM `<section id="why">` dari berkas rujukan:
  segel BPOM + judul berdampingan, satu paragraf, tabel banding yang bisa
  digulir mendatar, dan dialog registrasi.

  Dialognya dirender DI LUAR `<section>` tapi masih di dalam `.pdp4-page`,
  persis seperti rujukan: ia `position:fixed`, dan leluhur ber-`transform`
  akan menjadi containing block-nya sehingga ia berhenti mengukur diri dari
  viewport.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Template produk hanya ada satu per tema, sedangkan desain ini ditulis untuk
    satu produk saja. Section JSON tidak bisa dipasang bersyarat, jadi
    gerbangnya ada di sini. Kosongkan setting `handles` untuk semua produk.
  endcomment
  assign pdp4_on = false
  if section.settings.handles == blank
    assign pdp4_on = true
  else
    assign pdp4_needle = product.handle | prepend: ',' | append: ','
    assign pdp4_hay = section.settings.handles | remove: ' ' | prepend: ',' | append: ','
    if pdp4_hay contains pdp4_needle
      assign pdp4_on = true
    endif
  endif
-%}
{%- if pdp4_on -%}
{%- capture t_badge1 %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.badge_line_1, key: 'pdp3.why.badge_line_1' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_badge2 %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.badge_line_2, key: 'pdp3.why.badge_line_2' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_heading %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.heading, key: 'pdp3.why.heading' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_body %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.body, key: 'pdp3.why.body' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_crit %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.col_criteria, key: 'pdp3.why.col_criteria' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_us %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.col_us, key: 'pdp3.why.col_us' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_them %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.col_them, key: 'pdp3.why.col_them' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- capture t_mhead %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.modal_heading, key: 'pdp3.why.modal_heading' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Isi dialog dibangun dari LIMA baris `Label|Nilai`, bukan dari satu bongkah
  HTML.

  BUG yang pernah terjadi: dialognya menampilkan `<p><strong>Product:</strong>`
  sebagai teks biasa. Sebabnya filter `t` — ia meng-escape HTML, jadi markup
  apa pun yang disimpan di berkas locale sampai ke halaman sebagai tulisan,
  bukan sebagai tag. Tidak ada filter kebalikannya di Liquid.

  Jadi yang disimpan di locale cuma teks, dan `<p><b>` dirakit di sini. Setting
  richtext `modal_body` tetap ada sebagai penimpa untuk editor: nilai richtext
  memang HTML dan aman dicetak apa adanya.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture t_mrows -%}
  {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
    {%- capture k %}pdp3.why.modal_row_{{ i }}{% endcapture -%}
    {%- assign row = k | t -%}
    {%- if row contains 'Translation missing' or row == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign parts = row | split: '|' -%}
    <p class="sk-small">{% if parts.size > 1 %}<b class="sk-text-medium">{{ parts[0] | strip }}:</b> {{ parts[1] | strip }}{% else %}{{ row }}{% endif %}</p>
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign t_mbody = section.settings.modal_body -%}
{%- if t_mbody == blank -%}{%- assign t_mbody = t_mrows -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture t_mclose %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: section.settings.modal_close, key: 'pdp3.why.modal_close' %}{% endcapture -%}
<div class="pdp4-page sk-root">
<section class="sk-container sk-py-64" id="pdp4-why"><div class="pdp-wrap sk-stack" style="gap:var(--sk-space-24)">
  <div class="pdp-seal">
    {%- if section.settings.badge_image != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        `sk-light` adalah kelas kit untuk "pulau kertas di atas tinta". Lambang
        BPOM digambar hijau tua di atas transparan, jadi tanpa ground terang ia
        lenyap begitu paletnya gelap — dan itu yang terjadi di mode gelap
        sistem (laporan user 9 Sep). Rujukan pun tidak memakainya di sini;
        halaman ini memakainya karena ia yang punya mode gelap sungguhan.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="sk-card sk-card--outline sk-light pdp-seal__mark">
        {{ section.settings.badge_image | image_url: width: 192 | image_tag: widths: '64, 128, 192', sizes: '64px', loading: 'lazy', alt: 'BPOM' }}
      </span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="sk-stack" style="gap:var(--sk-space-8)">
      <h2 class="sk-h2">{% render 'pdp4-sentence-lines', text: t_heading %}</h2>
      {%- comment -%}
        Tombolnya SATU baris teks, bukan dua baris berlabel seperti generasi
        sebelumnya — rujukan merangkai keduanya dengan pemisah titik-tengah.
        Kedua setting locale-nya dipertahankan supaya terjemahan yang sudah ada
        tidak dibuang.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if t_badge1 != blank or t_badge2 != blank -%}
        <button class="sk-btn sk-btn--text sk-btn--sm pdp-seal__link" id="pdp4-bpom-btn" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog">{{ t_badge1 }}{% if t_badge1 != blank and t_badge2 != blank %} · {% endif %}{{ t_badge2 }}</button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- if t_body != blank -%}<p class="sk-body sk-text-secondary">{{ t_body }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="sk-scroll-x">
      <table class="pdp-cmp">
        <thead><tr><th><span class="pdp-sr">{{ t_crit }}</span></th><th class="us" scope="col">{{ t_us }}</th><th scope="col">{{ t_them }}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- capture k %}pdp3.why.{{ block.id }}{% endcapture -%}
            {%- assign k_crit = k | append: '.criteria' -%}
            {%- assign k_ours = k | append: '.ours' -%}
            {%- assign k_theirs = k | append: '.theirs' -%}
            {%- capture t_row_crit %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: block.settings.criteria, key: k_crit %}{% endcapture -%}
            {%- capture t_row_ours %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: block.settings.ours, key: k_ours %}{% endcapture -%}
            {%- capture t_row_theirs %}{% render 'pdp4-copy', value: block.settings.theirs, key: k_theirs %}{% endcapture -%}
            <tr {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><td class="k">{{ t_row_crit }}</td><td class="us">✓&nbsp; {{ t_row_ours }}</td><td class="no">✕&nbsp; {{ t_row_theirs }}</td></tr>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div></section>
{%- if t_mbody != blank -%}
  <div class="pdp-modal" id="pdp4-bpom-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="pdp4-bpom-title">
    <div class="sk-card sk-card--float sk-card--pad-lg sk-stack">
      <h3 class="sk-h3" id="pdp4-bpom-title">{{ t_mhead }}</h3>
      {{ t_mbody }}
      <button class="sk-btn sk-btn--outline" id="pdp4-bpom-close" type="button">{{ t_mclose }}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
</div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP4 Why this one",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "badge_image",
      "label": "Certificate badge"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_line_1",
      "label": "Badge line 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_line_2",
      "label": "Badge line 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Comparison table"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col_criteria",
      "label": "Criteria column label"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col_us",
      "label": "Our column"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col_them",
      "label": "Their column"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Registration dialog"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "modal_heading",
      "label": "Dialog heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "modal_body",
      "label": "Dialog body",
      "info": "Optional override. Leave blank to use the five registration rows from the locale files."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "modal_close",
      "label": "Dialog close label"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "handles",
      "label": "Only show for these product handles (comma separated)",
      "default": "organic-moringa-capsules"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "name": "Comparison row",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "criteria",
          "label": "Criteria"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ours",
          "label": "Treelogy"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "theirs",
          "label": "Others"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "tint_alt",
          "label": "Alternate tint",
          "default": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
